摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 多对话面板：并排查看并与多个 Agent 会话同时交互。","id":"gh:1338514004","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-multiple-chat-panels","slug":"WilliamShi666/dsh-multiple-chat-panels","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","mission-control","multi-pane"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 多对话面板：并排查看并与多个 Agent 会话同时交互。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-multiple-chat-panels"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Multiple chat panels for DeepSeek Harness: view and interact with several Agents side by side."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Terminal-native Agents (like Claude Code) give you a “god’s-eye view”: you can watch and steer multi"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ple conversations at once, and interact with several Agents in parallel. Most desktop and web harnes"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ses don’t offer this: you either work with a single Agent in a single conversation, or you juggle mu"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"ltiple windows and quickly lose context."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"在终端里使用 TUI 形态的 Agent（例如 Claude Code），你会获得一种“一览众山小”的上帝视角：可以同时查看和操控多个对话窗口，并与多个 Agent 并行互动。但很多桌面端或网页端的 "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"Harness 并不支持这种能力：要么只能在一个对话里和一个 Agent 交互，要么即使支持多 Agent / 多窗口，操作也非常繁琐。"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"multiple-chat-panels brings that same experience to DeepSeek Harness. Drag conversations from the le"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ft sidebar into the center area, and Mission Control opens with each session as a live, independentl"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"y interactive panel. With this “god’s-eye view”, you can significantly improve how you interact with"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" multiple Agents and how you handle multitasking, all without leaving your desktop or web UI. Availa"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ble in both dark and light mode."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"multiple-chat-panels 把这种体验带到了 DeepSeek Harness：你只需把左侧边栏里的对话拖到中间区域，Mission Control 就会把每个会话展开为一个可实时交互的"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"独立面板。有了这样“一览众山小”的上帝视角，你可以显著提升与多个 Agent 的交互能力，以及多任务（multitasking）的执行能力；无需离开桌面端或网页端 UI。支持深色与浅色模式。"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## v0.2.0 updates / v0.2.0 更新"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- Adapted for DeepSeek Harness v0.2.1-rc.2.\n- Panes now acquire Sessions through the public retain/r"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"elease ledger\n(`ctx.sessions.retain(id, { source })`), replacing the internal\n`SessionFace.open()` b"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ridge of 0.1: retaining a pane is what stages its\nhistory, and closing the pane releases it.\n- Fixed"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" drop-to-open again: the 0.2 shell moved the conversation root under\n`[data-slot=\"main.conversation\""},{"id":"p9s5","text":"]` and dropped `[data-dsh-center-col]`, which\nmade every sidebar drag silently do nothing. The centr"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"e column is now\nresolved from the `main` slot's rendered parent, with all older anchors kept.\n- Queu"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"ed messages read from the durable `inbox` projection (the 0.2 session\nsnapshot no longer carries a `"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"queue`), and local echoes still sending are\nshown beside them.\n- The permission control reads the pr"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"ocess catalog from\n`remote.permissionPresets` (the 0.2 projection carries the current value\nonly); t"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"he pane toolbar hides itself when no catalog is available.\n- The approval / plan-review hint follows"},{"id":"p9s11","text":" the Session UI status\n(`uiSession.sessionStatus` pending interaction) instead of guessing from\npend"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"ing prompts.\n- “Open in main conversation” uses Workspace navigation\n(`uiWorkspace.openSession`); `c"},{"id":"p9s13","text":"tx.sessions.open()` no longer exists.\n- Client builds now use the package's own pinned devDependenci"},{"id":"p9s14","text":"es: `pnpm\ninstall && npm run build` no longer needs a DSH source checkout."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- 已适配 DeepSeek Harness v0.2.1-rc.2。\n- 面板改用公开的 retain/release 机制\n（`ctx.sessions.retain(id, { source }"},{"id":"p10s2","text":")`）获取会话，取代 0.1 的内部\n`SessionFace.open()` 桥接：面板打开即持有引用并加载历史，关闭即释放。\n- 再次修复拖拽打开：0.2 外壳把对话根节点移到\n`[data-sl"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ot=\"main.conversation\"]` 下并移除了 `[data-dsh-center-col]`，\n导致侧边栏拖拽被静默忽略。中央列现在从 `main` 槽位最近的渲染父元素解析，\n同时保"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"留所有旧锚点。\n- 队列消息改读持久化的 `inbox` projection（0.2 的会话快照不再带 `queue`），\n尚未被接收的本地发送回显同时展示。\n- 权限控件从 `remote.per"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"missionPresets` 读取进程级目录\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## v0.1.2 updates / v0.1.2 更新"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- Adapted for DeepSeek Harness v0.1.5-rc.2.\n- Fixed drop-to-open: the centre conversation column mov"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ed to\n`[data-dsh-center-col]`, so the previous anchor made every drag silently do\nnothing. All three"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" shell generations are now recognised.\n- Read the transcript from the Conversation assembly\n(`uiConv"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ersation.binding(id).target('chat')`) instead of the session snapshot,\nwhich now carries lifecycle s"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"tate only.\n- Pass the `labels` that `MarkdownText` requires, so panes no longer crash on\ntheir first"},{"id":"p12s6","text":" Pass the `labels` that `MarkdownText` requires, so panes no longer crash on\ntheir first code block."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- 已适配 DeepSeek Harness v0.1.5-rc.2。\n- 修复拖拽无效：中央对话列改用 `[data-dsh-center-col]`，旧锚点导致拖拽被静默忽略；\n现在同时兼容三代外"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"壳。\n- 对话内容改从 Conversation assembly\n（`uiConversation.binding(id).target('chat')`）读取，会话快照现在只承载生命周期状态。\n-"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" 补齐 `MarkdownText` 必需的 `labels`，面板不再在首个代码块处崩溃。"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## v0.1.1 updates / v0.1.1 更新"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- Adapted for DeepSeek Harness v0.1.1-rc.2.\n- Runtime shell adapter supports both the original clien"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"t's\n`sidebar.primary.action` + `main.page` layout and the official Harness\n`sidebar.footer.action` +"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" `shell.overlay` layout.\n- Cross-row pane moves now preserve the live conversation view instead of r"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ebuilding it, making drag-and-drop noticeably more responsive for long chats."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- 已适配 DeepSeek Harness v0.1.1-rc.2。\n- 运行时外壳适配器同时支持原客户端的 `sidebar.primary.action` +\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## 兼容性 / Compatibility"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| 插件版本 / Plugin | 适配的 DeepSeek Harness / Harness |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| `0.2.0` | **v0.2.1-rc.2** 及以上 / and newer —— 使用 0.2 的 Session retain 机制、inbox projection 与权限目录 Rem"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ote |\n| `0.1.2` | v0.1.5-rc.2 —— 在 v0.2 上会话无法打开（`binding()` 不再隐式建立会话） / panes stay on `Loading sessi"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"on …` on v0.2 |\n| `0.1.1` | v0.1.1-rc.2 —— 在 v0.1.5-rc.2 上拖拽无响应（中央列锚点已变更） / dragging does nothing on"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"|\n| `0.1.1` | v0.1.1-rc.2 —— 在 v0.1.5-rc.2 上拖拽无响应（中央列锚点已变更） / dragging does nothing on v0.1.5-rc.2 |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"上面的安装命令装的是 `latest`（当前适配 v0.2.x）。**如果你的 DSH 是 v0.1.5-rc.2，请显式安装 0.1.2**，否则面板会一直停在 `Loading session …"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"的安装命令装的是 `latest`（当前适配 v0.2.x）。**如果你的 DSH 是 v0.1.5-rc.2，请显式安装 0.1.2**，否则面板会一直停在 `Loading session …`："},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The command above installs `latest` (built for v0.2.x). **On a v0.1.5-rc.2 Harness, pin 0.1.2**, or "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"panes stay on `Loading session …`:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
